# systemd 서비스 — 서버가 켜질 때 사이트가 자동으로 뜨고, 죽으면 다시 살아납니다.
# 복사: sudo cp deploy/kb.service /etc/systemd/system/kb.service
# 켜기: sudo systemctl daemon-reload && sudo systemctl enable --now kb
[Unit]
Description=Vietnam direct-purchase helper (Next.js)
After=network.target

[Service]
Type=simple
User=kb
WorkingDirectory=/srv/kb
EnvironmentFile=/srv/kb/.env.local
Environment=NODE_ENV=production
Environment=PORT=3000
ExecStart=/usr/bin/npm run start
Restart=always
RestartSec=5

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
